elerate client impact. At IBM Consulting, curiosity fuels success. You\u2019ll be encouraged to challenge the norm, explore new ideas, and create innovative solutions that deliver real results. Our culture of growth and empathy focuses on your long\\-term career development while valuing your unique skills and experiences.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Your Role And Responsibilities**\n As a Data Engineer specializing in Data Platforms\\-SnowFlake, you play a critical role in building and enhancing Snowflake platforms for clients' Data and AI use cases. This position focuses on implementing Data and AI use cases on Snowflake platforms.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Your Primary Responsibilities Will Include**\n* Implement Data and AI Use Cases: Implement data and AI use cases on Snowflake platforms, ensuring seamless integration and optimal performance.\n* Enhance Snowflake Platform: Build and enhance Snowflake platforms to meet the evolving needs of clients' Data and AI use cases.\n* Leverage Key Skills: Apply expertise in Snowflake, data engineering, and cloud computing to deliver high\\-quality solutions.\n\n\n**Preferred Education**\n Master's Degree\n   \n\n  \n\n**Required Technical And Professional Expertise**\n* Snowflake Platform Expertise: Experience with Snowflake platforms, including building, enhancing, and implementing data and AI use cases to meet client needs.\n* Data Engineering Knowledge: Experience working with data engineering principles and practices to deliver high\\-quality solutions on Snowflake platforms.\n* Cloud Computing Skills: Exposure to cloud computing concepts and technologies, with an understanding of how they integrate with Snowflake platforms.\n* Implementation Expertise: Experience implementing data and AI use cases on Snowflake platforms, ensuring seamless integration and optimal performance.\n* Technical Solution Delivery: Experience applying technical expertise to deliver solutions that meet client needs, leveraging Snowflake, data engineering, and cloud computing skills.\n\n\n**Preferred Technical And Professional Experience**\n* Cloud Integration Knowledge: Exposure to integrating cloud computing concepts and technologies with Snowflake platforms, enhancing data and AI use case implementation.\n* Advanced Data Engineering: Experience working with data engineering principles and practices to deliver high\\-quality solutions on Snowflake platforms, leveraging expertise in Snowflake and cloud computing.\n* Technical Solution Optimization: Experience applying technical expertise to optimize solutions on Snowflake platforms, ensuring seamless integration and optimal performance for data and AI use cases."},{"title":"Data Engineer-Data Integration","company":"IBM","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-07-16","url":"https://www.foundit.in/job/data-engineer-data-integration-ibm-bengaluru-bangalore-59182226"},{"title":"Data Engineer","company":"IBM","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-07-16","url":"https://www.foundit.in/job/data-engineer-ibm-bengaluru-bangalore-59182567","experience":"2-4 Years"},{"title":"Big Data Engineer - Xebia","company":"HR","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-08-11","url":"https://www.foundit.in/job/big-data-engineer-xebia-foray-software-private-limited-hyderabad-secunderabad-telangana-34964558","experience":"3-7 Years"},{"title":"Data Engineer-Data Platforms-Azure","company":"IBM","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-08-18","url":"https://www.foundit.in/job/data-engineer-data-platforms-azure-ibm-pune-63111203"},{"title":"Big Data Engineer - Xebia","company":"HR","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-08-11","url":"https://www.foundit.in/job/big-data-engineer-xebia-foray-software-private-limited-hyderabad-secunderabad-telangana-34964558","experience":"3-7 Years"},{"title":"Data Engineer-Data Modeling","company":"IBM","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-08-30","url":"https://www.foundit.in/job/data-engineer-data-modeling-ibm-bengaluru-bangalore-64811763"}]